  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656488",
      "title": "TD: Setting and Patching Form Values",
      "lectureOrder": 523,
      "videoOrder": 479,
      "sourceHash": "edfb972d9c261239373469848fae7e3a3e71b99cfa92feeae5fab6d0ae221e23",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 3.06,
          "end": 6.09,
          "en": "-: We learned lot about the template of the approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.09,
          "end": 9.21,
          "en": "Before concluding this first part of the module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.21,
          "end": 12.51,
          "en": "let's have a look at this suggestion username button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.51,
          "end": 13.8,
          "en": "it doesn't work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.8,
          "end": 17.55,
          "en": "But I added this suggest username method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.55,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "where I created a default username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 23.64,
          "en": "Now it would be nice that up on clicking this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.64,
          "end": 28.64,
          "en": "we populate this username input here with this username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.15,
          "end": 31.98,
          "en": "Now you could think about some solutions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.98,
          "end": 35.43,
          "en": "using two-way data binding and they would probably work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.43,
          "end": 39.75,
          "en": "You could two-way data bind this to a username property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.75,
          "end": 42.486,
          "en": "Which you then change with this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.486,
          "end": 45.45,
          "en": "I just want to show you a different approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.45,
          "end": 48.51,
          "en": "Remember that we do have access to this form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.51,
          "end": 50.85,
          "en": "Through view child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.85,
          "end": 55.85,
          "en": "Of course, it would be nice if we could set the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.92,
          "end": 59.61,
          "en": "of one of our inputs, and turns out we can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.61,
          "end": 63.18,
          "en": "For this, we get two different methods we can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.18,
          "end": 68.18,
          "en": "The first one would be on our sign up form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 71.074,
          "end": 74.97,
          "en": "the set value property method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.97,
          "end": 77.88,
          "en": "This allows you to set the value of the whole form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.88,
          "end": 80.61,
          "en": "And here we need to pass a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.61,
          "end": 83.43,
          "en": "exactly representing our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.43,
          "end": 86.78999999999999,
          "en": "So we need to use or set up user data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "which is an object two, where we have, let's check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "a username, field username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "Set to the suggested name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 103.85,
          "en": "and then also email, set to maybe an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 104.52000000000001,
          "end": 109.52000000000001,
          "en": "and secret set to pet maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 113.7,
          "en": "And question answer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 113.7,
          "end": 117.78,
          "en": "keep in mind this is this text area here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 121.68,
          "en": "So question, answer, set to an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 121.68,
          "end": 126.68,
          "en": "And last but not least, the gender, set to male.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 128.52,
          "end": 131.28,
          "en": "And with this all added, let's go to our template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 131.28,
          "end": 134.58,
          "en": "and hook up this button, this button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 134.58,
          "end": 138.3,
          "en": "which is a type button so that it doesn't submit the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 138.3,
          "end": 139.71,
          "en": "And here I'll add a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 139.71,
          "end": 142.92000000000002,
          "en": "and target these suggest username method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 142.92000000000002,
          "end": 145.95,
          "en": "So if this now recompiles and we hit this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 145.95,
          "end": 148.32,
          "en": "you see superuser was entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 151.497,
          "en": "However, this approach does have one downside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 151.497,
          "end": 154.29,
          "en": "If we already had some value entered there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 154.29,
          "end": 157.14,
          "en": "and then wanted to click suggest a username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 160.47,
          "en": "it well, overrides all our other content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 160.47,
          "end": 163.29,
          "en": "So this is not necessarily the best approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 163.29,
          "end": 166.02,
          "en": "However it does show you how you can set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 166.02,
          "end": 170.7,
          "en": "the values of all controls with one convenient command,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 170.7,
          "end": 175.14,
          "en": "with the set value command, where you pass an exact copy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 175.14,
          "end": 177.15,
          "en": "of the form, of the form value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 177.15,
          "end": 179.28,
          "en": "I should say as a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 179.28,
          "end": 182.49,
          "en": "and can override the value of each control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 182.49,
          "end": 185.49,
          "en": "Now, as mentioned, this is not the best approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 185.49,
          "end": 187.65,
          "en": "So let's comment it out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 187.65,
          "end": 191.25,
          "en": "The better approach here would be to access the signup form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.25,
          "end": 194.79,
          "en": "and now actually the form object on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 194.79,
          "end": 198.06,
          "en": "because signup form this overall NG form object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 198.06,
          "end": 202.92000000000002,
          "en": "is kind of the container of your form, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 202.92000000000002,
          "end": 205.86,
          "en": "And there you also have the patch value method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 205.86,
          "end": 208.82999999999998,
          "en": "So this is not available on the signup form itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 208.82999999999998,
          "end": 211.98,
          "en": "but on the form group wrapped inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.98,
          "end": 215.04,
          "en": "And here you can pass JavaScript object two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 215.04,
          "end": 219.66,
          "en": "where you only override specific certain controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 219.66,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "So here you could also pass user data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 225.6,
          "en": "Let me restructure this so that it's easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 225.6,
          "end": 230.6,
          "en": "User data, and then inside of user data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 234.66,
          "en": "here, you might want to override the user name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 234.66,
          "end": 236.31,
          "en": "Set it to it's adjusted name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 239.19,
          "en": "but don't override any other value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 239.19,
          "end": 242.01,
          "en": "So with this in place, if I now save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.01,
          "end": 244.65,
          "en": "and I already have a email address entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 244.65,
          "end": 248.07,
          "en": "and something here and here, and I click this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.07,
          "end": 250.29,
          "en": "now it only added superuser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.29,
          "end": 253.41,
          "en": "and left all my other controls untouched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.41,
          "end": 255.66,
          "en": "So set value and patch value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 255.66,
          "end": 258.09,
          "en": "important patch value only available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.09,
          "end": 261.78,
          "en": "on the form wrapped by NG form itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 261.78,
          "end": 264.99,
          "en": "As a side note, set value would be available here too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 264.99,
          "end": 267.48,
          "en": "So these two commands are very helpful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.48,
          "end": 271.38,
          "en": "Set value, to set your whole form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 271.38,
          "end": 275.55,
          "en": "Patch value to override parts of the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.55,
          "end": 278.46,
          "en": "Very useful helper methods I wanted to bring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.46,
          "end": 279.663,
          "en": "to your attention.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
